  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad online audience familiar with internet meme culture, animal-based humor, and social commentary. It leverages widely understood visual tropes (injured animal + text overlay) and metaphorical animal dynamics (dog vs. cat) to convey a message about bullying. The target community includes individuals who engage with social media, understand the use of animal metaphors for human social issues, and are likely to respond to emotionally evocative imagery (e.g., the sad pug) paired with a call to action (intervention request).",
